      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu062-ws2118588.wikitext",
      "revision": 2118588,
      "line": 36,
      "start": 115,
      "quote": "稱疾不就",
      "sha256": "0de7f5d906faab4e006b36f365ca336c693156b0b9f56582b1c0334cb8288b9f",
      "note": "早證解釋句中所授官職。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu062-ws2118588.wikitext",
      "revision": 2118588,
      "line": 44,
      "start": 51,
      "quote": "又與從弟僧綽書",
      "sha256": "0de7f5d906faab4e006b36f365ca336c693156b0b9f56582b1c0334cb8288b9f",
      "note": "微、綽的同族長幼。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu062-ws2118588.wikitext",
      "revision": 2118588,
      "line": 64,
      "start": 13,
      "quote": "如此者十餘年",
      "sha256": "0de7f5d906faab4e006b36f365ca336c693156b0b9f56582b1c0334cb8288b9f",
      "note": "宋62門屋時間，南21不記年數。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu062-ws2118588.wikitext",
      "revision": 2118588,
      "line": 64,
      "start": 32,
      "quote": "弟僧謙，亦有才譽",
      "sha256": "0de7f5d906faab4e006b36f365ca336c693156b0b9f56582b1c0334cb8288b9f",
      "note": "不同於王曇首子僧虔。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu062-ws2118588.wikitext",
      "revision": 2118588,
      "line": 76,
      "start": 0,
      "quote": "元嘉三十年，卒，時年三十九",
      "sha256": "0de7f5d906faab4e006b36f365ca336c693156b0b9f56582b1c0334cb8288b9f",
      "note": "今校元嘉三十、三十九。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu062-ws2118588.wikitext",
      "revision": 2118588,
      "line": 76,
      "start": 31,
      "quote": "「三十年」各本並作「二十年」，「三十九」各本並作「二十九」",
      "sha256": "0de7f5d906faab4e006b36f365ca336c693156b0b9f56582b1c0334cb8288b9f",
      "note": "校記稱各本作二十、二十九。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu062-ws2118588.wikitext",
      "revision": 2118588,
      "line": 76,
      "start": 211,
      "quote": "何長史者，偃也",
      "sha256": "0de7f5d906faab4e006b36f365ca336c693156b0b9f56582b1c0334cb8288b9f",
      "note": "琴受贈的何偃。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/songshu062-ws2118588.wikitext",
      "revision": 2118588,
      "line": 76,
      "start": 288,
      "quote": "可追贈祕書監",
      "sha256": "0de7f5d906faab4e006b36f365ca336c693156b0b9f56582b1c0334cb8288b9f",
      "note": "宋書明文為宋孝武追贈，南史作贈秘書監。"
    }
  ],
